      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The client observes one successful request: it cannot tell that A stalled, and it never saw a 200 that would have committed it to A.\nA stream that emits no content frame within ttft_timeout_ms is abandoned even though its HTTP handshake succeeded.",
